 false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2026-04-23 饮茶后心慌、手抖，社区医院急诊，挂号+心电图+检查共 320 元，发票与病历留存；医生怀疑摄入刺激性成分。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"4a57da2e-cefe-4557-894e-85fdd73b7a8b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2026-04-25 卖家客服回复：最多退货退款，拒绝赔偿；并称赵萌“知假买假、职业打假”。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"63b7acf6-396c-439a-8ec8-3557084308e7\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2026-04-28 发出书面索赔函：退款 + 按《食品安全法》第148条十倍赔偿，限 10 日内答复。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"e9ff4e56-07ef-4a6a-817e-169d70fdc5d3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2026-05-16 明确检验预算与要求：不超过 3000 元，只测标签符合性 + 非法添加，须 CMA（最好 CNAS）、独立无关联、不接受“保证检出/按结果收费”。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"1c7d3723-6491-4eed-8375-db4d7a950504\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\