26-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"卖家拒绝赔偿：邮件 #4；索赔函：邮件 #20（Sent）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"114df313-41c8-4941-897e-9c42df451c83\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"就医费用：邮件 #8（320 元、发票、病历）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"303ba60f-6778-4c62-82be-df6f644fe9de\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"商品页面功效宣传：邮件 #31；卖家/平台主体：邮件 #30。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c9a4312e-927b-47bc-8eb1-35034f59b68a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"待补：平台订单详情页、支付账单截图、与卖家完整聊天记录、商品实物正反面照片、卖家工商登记信息、平台投诉记录、检验报告。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"e43b7c0d-b469-4c27-8991-6337a5d6d1eb\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"四、法律依据（初步）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"65f6b39d-b582-4260-860c-ccc5d50f9518\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第97条：进口预包装食品应当有中文标签、中文说明书，载明原产地及境内代理商名称、地址、联系方式；没有中文标签、中文说明书的不得进口。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"314ac3e3-5403-48c1-8ba1-2ace8a724e06\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第34条：禁止生产经营无标签的预包装食品、添加食品添加剂以外化学物质或其他可能危害人体健康物质的食品。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"652668e6-e6ca-47cc-8257-82b33d372170\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第148条：经营明知不符合食品安全标准的食品，消费者可要求退款并主张价款十倍或损失三倍赔偿，不足1000元按1000元计；但标签、说明书存在“不影响食品安全且不会误导”的瑕疵除外。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"cbde6204-d969-4f00-8a15-655c3c4ca085\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《消费者权益保护法》第44条：平台不能提供销售者真实名称、地址、有效联系方式的，消费者可向平台索赔；平台明知/应知侵权未采取必要措施的，承担连带责任。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"914c6d9c-02d5-4221-8e23-161ffc20c698\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《消费者权益保护法》第55条：普通消费欺诈为价款三倍（保底500元）。食品不安全优先适用《食品安全法》第148条十倍，不重复主张。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5416a7e8-f7cb-4aaa-88f4-b87aa4c68ca9\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"最高法食品药品纠纷规定第3条（经 (2025)沪01民终05600号确认）：食品、药品领域，销售者以购买者“明知有问题仍购买”抗辩的，法院不予支持。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"ebc2dd7a-d4a0-4655-8062-3c19781eb5f0\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"五、可以主张什么（初步方案）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6ce8cdb8-66e9-4740-89a2-172eeb248a03\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"1）退还货款 1,880 元：两件商品均不符合食品安全标准，可要求退货退款。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"1918ad70-80b1-40c4-8a46-d8a557c75d7b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2）惩罚性赔偿 18,800 元：按价款十倍（1,880×10）。若法院按单品拆分，奶粉 680×10=6,800，茶 1,200×10=12,000，合计相同。退一赔十合计 20,680 元。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"ee103560-b7e0-4192-8e40-c151b956f44b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"3）医疗费 320 元及合理交通费：实际损失，另行主张；不并入十倍基数。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"574401af-74b8-4d01-8a15-115d9ecf7731\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"4）检验费（实际发生，预算≤3,000 元）：先由赵萌垫付，诉请由被告承担。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"0ea5f9ae-d7cc-4b77-872b-a6c00087155c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"5）精神损害抚慰金 20,000 元：不建议作为主诉请求。一般需“严重精神损害”后果，320 元急诊较难达到；可留作谈判筹码，但别让法官觉得漫天要价。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6419daf5-9dfc-47e7-8ae9-845dec33a27f\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"6）平台责任：目前卖家主体信息明确，暂不列优鲜购为被告；但应书面投诉并保留平台回复。若卖家失联或平台拒不提供资质，再依《消保法》第44条追加平台。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"fd63287f-4f08-4a3c-8e22-74a6ba7c67f2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"六、风险与应对\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a325d411-2754-41c3-8926-474b506bec84\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"卖家说“知假买假、职业打假”：不成立。食品领域明确规定该抗辩不支持（(2025)沪01民终05600号）。且各买 1 件属合理生活消费，不属于大额囤购（对比 (2024)浙0110民初18700号）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"03ab66aa-ec14-4d41-80ae-fbd93b9a6d12\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"“标签瑕疵”例外：例外仅限不影响食品安全且不误导的轻微瑕疵。整罐无中文标签，消费者无法知悉成分、保质期、境内代理商，不属于轻微瑕疵（(2025)沪0112民初18900号）。对比仅字号问题的 (2025)沪0112民初16800号。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"e08e7f73-4603-46e0-82df-1e777eb4e8aa\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"茶的功效宣传：普通食品宣称治疗高血压、降血糖，且无保健食品批号，法院有支持十倍的先例（(2025)沪0112民初15800号）。即使未检出非法添加，也可依标签/宣传违规主张。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b0398e52-5da9-4c77-8546-b014c766b74b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"非法添加：需检验报告支撑。检出西布曲明等非食用物质，直接构成不符合食品安全标准（(2025)沪0115民初20300号）。若未检出，不影响奶粉无中文标签的十倍主张。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b5dbd87b-6fe3-4444-82d7-57c2e7acfe75\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"十倍基数争议：若法院认为茶仅为宣传欺诈、不构成食品安全问题，备选请求为奶粉十倍 6,800 元 + 茶按消法三倍 3,600 元（1,200×3），合计 10,400 元；庭审中作为备位主张提出。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c4ecee2a-e867-4c01-8e53-151cbefdf174\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"检验报告被采信：必须选有 CMA（最好 CNAS）资质的食品检验机构，且独立于卖家；无资质报告不采信（(2025)沪01民终06100号）。拒绝“保证检出/按结果收费”。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7b4b0e40-0865-446c-8891-e9287c843b12\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"证据保全：商品继续原样封存，不要拆封或丢弃；开箱视频保留原始文件与拍摄时间；聊天记录做完整导出，不只截片段。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"8751e076-864b-4a8d-8ba9-9379266908fd\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"七、类似判例（已检索并存入法律检索库）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2765dfb4-03c3-4b78-88f8-c3d23833fa17\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"说明：检索库里原先没有你收藏的判例；以下 9 篇是与本案最相关的公开判例，已存入你的收藏并逐篇加了备注。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3343b196-b077-4884-83ca-8594cb8c270a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"① (2025)沪0112民初18900号（上海闵行法院）：进口预包装食品整罐无中文标签，属不符合食品安全标准，支持价款十倍。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2cd85de6-818f-4ae1-841a-556a778c8606\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"② (2025)沪0112民初15800号（上海闵行法院）：普通食品无保健食品批号却宣称治疗高血压、降糖，支持十倍赔偿。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"588894a3-9684-477c-80cb-cfed11cb539e\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"③ (2025)沪01民终05600号（上海一中院）：食品领域“知假买假”不影响十倍索赔，销售者抗辩被驳回。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"69d97b37-92d0-4e40-8496-fe03afdbe9be\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"④ (2025)沪0115民初20300号（上海浦东法院）：代用茶检出非法添加物（西布曲明等），支持价款十倍。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5ec6a4bd-dd04-4d7e-8e1f-304b0b231778\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⑤ (2025)沪01民终06100号（上海一中院）：无 CMA/CNAS 资质机构出具的检验报告不被采信。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"d9343e16-6954-407f-8a53-cd9a76f4b114\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⑥ (2025)沪0112民初16200号（上海闵行法院）：网购合同收货地为合同履行地，可在上海起诉杭州卖家。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"e2184d27-f077-4f3c-8488-13397fa31189\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⑦ (2025)沪0112民初17200号（上海闵行法院）：卖家失联、平台不能提供真实信息，平台先行赔付。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"68f16123-dc49-4f29-8a88-2377743368a7\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⑧ (2025)浙0110民初13900号（杭州余杭法院）：价款十倍与损失三倍择一，按更有利消费者计算。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6e0b440d-62e6-4afc-8406-7e2e1779c619\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"⑨ (2024)浙0110民初18700号（杭州余杭法院）：明显超出合理生活消费的大额囤购，超出部分十倍赔偿审慎认定（本案各 1 件，不适用）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7827caad-6aee-41cd-885a-aca79b1e4856\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"反面参照：(2025)沪0112民初16800号，仅标签字号等不影响安全且不误导的轻微瑕疵，不支持十倍——本案整罐无中文标签，不属于该情形。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"fe658495-712d-4e9f-8a11-62ed92260440\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"八、下一步行动清单\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"eab684de-b906-4123-8b46-af9758b787b7\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"今天：新建“维权证据”文件夹，导出订单页、支付账单、完整聊天记录、开箱视频原文件、就医发票与病历；商品继续封存。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"9a59518f-8a15-428b-89ab-eb71bc6613c5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"3 日内：在国家企业信用信息公示系统打印杭州环球优选食品有限公司登记信息；向优鲜购书面投诉，要求提供卖家资质及奶粉入境货物检验检疫证明，保留平台回复。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"97e36bb5-cef0-490b-81db-264fa1afcb86\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"1 周内：按≤3000 元预算筛选 CMA（最好 CNAS）食品检验机构，确认可测“中文标签符合性 + 非法添加”、报价与周期，并确认报告可用于上海法院。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"023d4eeb-9bcf-4537-8ee5-192cdde009bf\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"2 周内：取得检验报告后，向上海市浦东新区人民法院网上立案；诉请：退款 1,880 + 十倍赔偿 18,800 + 医疗费 320 + 检验费 + 诉讼费。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b3692257-ee80-45ba-8fca-07e9d7bfa957\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"同步：通过 12315 向市场监管部门投诉（标签违法、普通食品宣称疗效），固定行政投诉记录，作为诉讼辅助证据。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"503dc10f-2ca6-41b9-8436-5f1a848855b3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"to_do\", \"to_do\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"开庭前：准备证据目录与原件，整理“知假买假不影响索赔”“无中文标签非轻微瑕疵”两份判例要点，一页纸提交法庭。\"}}], \"checked\": false}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"372895ac-3736-408c-8c28-b96c9b6d455a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"九、备注与预期管理\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"63bbf0ea-c64c-4f88-820a-40beaa93b7f1\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"你妈妈说“顶多退一赔三”——那是普通消费欺诈的《消法》第55条；食品不安全适用《食品安全法》第148条，是十倍（保底1000元），不是三倍。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c873830f-f7e6-4892-820b-28c6d8c2a58d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"卖家拿“看过差评”说你知假买假——食品领域这条抗辩不成立；而且你各买 1 件，是正常生活消费。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"91b2eaa2-e7d4-4a4f-89db-79bed090813d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"精神损害 2 万：可以谈，但别写进主诉请求；法院通常要求严重后果，320 元急诊很难支持，写高了反而削弱可信度。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"87168685-ee6b-4b59-8874-05f5dbca3b09\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"诉讼费预估：标的约 21,000 元，受理费约 325 元；适用简易程序减半约 163 元，胜诉后由被告负担。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6e69260f-c575-47e4-8bb8-d25ad00cf6a8\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"00f08177-9b83-4543-8a42-6470b5435b77\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"案件状态：2026-05-20 建页；索赔函 10 日期限已于 2026-05-08 届满，卖家未履行，可直接进入检验与起诉准备。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
