pe\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"事实认定强：茶含非法添加物是法院认定，不依赖你后来有没有拿到 JY-006 报告；奶粉无中文标签有实物、视频、照片。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"87aed2ab-525b-4c16-884d-0cab023ff6ca\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"但不是终局：一审判决要等 15 日上诉期（至 2026-07-01）过完才生效；对方仍可能上诉。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"ad9119de-c607-41ac-85f1-b8b261f13a80\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"上诉改判难度：对方若只重复“三倍/知假买假/标签瑕疵”，二审改判空间不大；但二审可能组织调解、拖时间，不能保证百分百维持。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"190601b1-ca56-4097-8fd4-b7a81c27222e\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"八、要不要“见好就收”\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"67f35333-8f83-48e1-8169-57561d0ffc2a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"callout\", \"callout\": {\"icon\": {\"type\": \"emoj