item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"对方上诉期：判决送达之日起 15 日，至 2026-07-01。对方上诉后会通过法院送达上诉状副本。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"01f608b5-742c-4f87-8e82-e537a097fe0a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"你收到上诉状副本后，通常 15 日内提交答辩状；不提交不影响审理，但建议提交，把一审的“无中文标签/非法添加/十倍”再讲一遍。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"40106d63-f2f0-4445-8afb-0f3b1c9438dc\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"二审法院：上海市第一中级人民法院。一审判决未生效，不能申请执行；等二审判决/调解书。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"01aa1ddd-da6d-4ee3-80b0-a0ddd92e29aa\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"二审策略：不新增无关争点，只守一审认定；对方若拿“三倍/知假买假/标签瑕疵”再说，直接用一审判决和 f02/f04/f12 回应。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b58c68c6-3afa-471d-878a-08310c17ec15\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"十、赔偿款会不会被拖\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c410fd17-0fe8-4440-8aeb-fe10b8af2f66\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"有可能。判决不等于自动到账，尤其卖家店铺已暂停营业、电话打不通；胜诉后还要看履行和执行。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"67528829-1737-4d0a-85c8-e33f3d78f974\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"先看判决主文的履行主体：如果平台被判共同/连带付款，执行平台更稳；如果只判卖家，先查卖家工商状态和财产线索。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"9f694d52-d555-465d-8db0-ad35e2856be8\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"如双方都不上诉：7/2 起生效；向法院申请生效证明，按判决履行期限催款；到期不付，2 年内申请强制执行。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a8f5e3d2-03c6-4f11-8529-32577585b937\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"执行材料：执行申请书、判决书、生效证明、身份证、被执行人信息、财产线索；可申请查询银行/房产/车辆，申请限制高消费/失信名单。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b0fa5cde-6d4a-4b9c-8106-103049234eb2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"如果只判卖家且卖家是空壳：执行可能困难；这时才考虑就平台责任上诉或另诉平台，但要先看判决主文和平台证据，不要盲目。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"4215c221-af30-46fd-8386-1b32f93e8928\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"33ed285b-8ca4-48a0-826c-4c5c5a8ba35a\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"callout\", \"callout\": {\"icon\": {\"type\": \"emoji\", \"emoji\": \"📌\"}, \"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"一句话：结果很好，不建议主动上诉；7/1 前盯对方是否上诉；不上诉就 7/2 生效、按履行期催款，不付就执行。钱没到账前不退货。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
