text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第97条：进口预包装食品必须有中文标签、中文说明书。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6d40530c-7696-4eb9-878d-f52c3dc5e6bf\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第34条：禁止生产经营无标签食品、非法添加食品。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"9ca6cb58-686e-4790-8ad6-8c3853746995\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《食品安全法》第148条：退款 + 价款十倍/损失三倍，择高；不足 1,000 元按 1,000 元。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a1b6b23e-1a81-467c-8c41-8d12a222ae5d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"《消保法》第44条：平台不能提供卖家真实信息/不处理时，先行赔付或连带。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"28fcc803-f2a6-40f6-8cce-d5a2bb7929b3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"最高法食药纠纷规定第3条：食品领域“知假买假”抗辩不成立。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"61fd1499-5e9c-43ab-804a-3616d34823a1\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"判例：f02 无中文标签十倍、f18 无检验检疫证明十倍、f13 普通食品宣称疗效十倍、f06 代用茶非法添加十倍、f04 知假买假不成立、f12 区分三倍与十倍。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"9dfd32ed-2971-49dd-8696-df1a505d37d4\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"五、成本账（已知/预估，实际以票据为准）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"eccef131-bdc5-4bf9-8844-1b614e85bee5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"货款：1,880 元（已付，判决退还）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"53b30cd4-361b-44a8-8377-cdcb04d983d4\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"医疗费：320 元（已付，判决赔偿）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2f3d2120-edae-4d65-87c7-6dfad69e079d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"诉讼费：按 21,000 元标的约 325 元；简易程序减半约 163 元；判决由被告负担，实际以票据为准。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b6c68b27-ad0d-47e9-8e13-23b08a07d7fe\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"检验费：预算上限 3,000 元；JY-006 暂停后是否已付/退款、JY-008 是否付费，需按票据确认；判决未单列检验费。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"b85c65d6-f19f-47ff-8079-b34b0f51899a\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"交通/打印/邮寄：未单独记账，粗估 100-300 元。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2f0a2324-c6cd-4d95-8f4e-677922f4d5bb\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"律师咨询/代理：5/22 有面询，费用未在材料中体现；如有票据请补。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"6cdeadf5-f1c3-4ca4-88c4-2e9f9cbf5302\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"时间成本：4/18-6/22，约 2 个月；1 次开庭、多轮书面材料、多次催告/投诉。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"77488c8c-4605-484e-8282-d3e94ce39291\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"情绪成本：高。卖家失联、机构资质暂停、上诉拖时间，都比预想耗人。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"42b12c72-939a-4747-8884-5cca0050bf7b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"callout\", \"callout\": {\"icon\": {\"type\": \"emoji\", \"emoji\": \"💰\"}, \"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"判决支持 21,000 + 受理费；实际净收益 = 判决金额 - 检验费 - 交通/打印 - 律师费（如有）。把票据补齐后算一次，心里才有数。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"21b9448a-163b-4dfc-8fab-9f8d3b99554b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"六、经验教训（给身边人参考）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"83ab2692-36ca-420c-85af-821501785b68\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"下单和收货时就开始留证：订单、支付、商品页面、客服聊天、开箱视频、快递面单、包装和实物，全部留。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"0a770507-9252-4d00-8676-c3e32bb75924\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"发现问题后不要先退货、不要寄回、不要拆封；商品是核心物证，退了就被动。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c5e86695-6648-4387-8a6a-5ef2816a3128\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"所有沟通尽量书面化：邮件、平台聊天、12315 工单；口头承诺不算数。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"021516f8-1663-4338-8dc6-e46821f88926\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"身体不适先就医，保留发票、病历、费用明细；把“食用—症状—就诊”时间线写清楚。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"850f1d12-6b51-4db4-8565-0049d201e92e\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"检验机构先查 CMA/CNAS 资质和范围，必须独立、固定收费、不与结果挂钩；别找“保证检出”的。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"4344a37a-a786-4284-8808-3bca463a4a66\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"网购食品纠纷在收货地法院起诉，不用去卖家所在地；被告先列卖家，平台作为后备。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"7c81064a-95bb-44a4-8dec-38a3a2d12586\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"食品不安全是《食品安全法》第148条十倍，不是《消法》第55条三倍；不要被“最多退一赔三”忽悠。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"cf5b7435-d4a6-403b-8d56-ca95ddcd9d2c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"“知假买假”在食品领域不影响索赔；各买 1 件属合理消费，不要被“职业打假”吓退。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"1b3a5b9a-369c-4666-8d02-ea8650e12df2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"不要提精神损害 2 万这种没有依据的请求；抬高诉讼费，还显得外行。\"}}]}}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5b01eda9-61e0-4880-8e4a-b5b9cff15994\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"胜诉不等于拿到钱：起诉前查卖家工商/经营状态，考虑平台责任；判决后及时申请执行。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c31f930a-982f-4e87-82b4-de8c9d748cec\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_2\", \"heading_2\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"七、如果重来，我会怎么做\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a87377dc-e47e-4878-8122-33d8e3ad9ce5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"第一天就建“证据+费用”两个文件夹，所有票据当天归档，不等到复盘才找。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2470d477-4856-4be7-8707-e9a7d8760619\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"a9edd3f8-e04f-468c-8e4e-5090790f6f69\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"更早送检，并且先确认机构资质状态；JY-006 暂停这种事，早点有备选就不会被动。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
}

